anrique A.", "authorList": {"author": [{"fullName": "Agostini D", "lastName": "Agostini", "firstName": "Denis", "initials": "D", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Nuclear Medicine, CHU Caen, CHU Cote de Nacre, Caen, France. agostini-de@chu-caen.fr."}, {"affiliation": "Normandy University, EA 4650, Caen, France. agostini-de@chu-caen.fr."}]}}, {"fullName": "Roule V", "lastName": "Roule", "firstName": "Vincent", "initials": "V", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Cardiology, CHU Caen, Caen, France."}]}}, {"fullName": "Nganoa C", "lastName": "Nganoa", "firstName": "Catherine", "initials": "C", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Nuclear Medicine, CHU Caen, CHU Cote de Nacre, Caen, France."}]}}, {"fullName": "Roth N", "lastName": "Roth", "firstName": "Nathaniel", "initials": "N", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Spectrum Dynamics Medical Ltd., Caesarea, Israel."}]}}, {"fullName": "Baavour R", "lastName": "Baavour", "firstName": "Raphael", "initials": "R", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Spectrum Dynamics Medical Ltd., Caesarea, Israel."}]}}, {"fullName": "Parienti JJ", "lastName": "Parienti", "firstName": "Jean-Jacques", "initials": "JJ", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Biometrics and Statistics, CHU Caen, Caen, France."}]}}, {"fullName": "Beygui F", "lastName": "Beygui", "firstName": "Farzin", "initials": "F", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Normandy University, EA 4650, Caen, France."}, {"affiliation": "Department of Cardiology, CHU Caen, Caen, France."}]}}, {"fullName": "Manrique A", "lastName": "Manrique", "firstName": "Alain", "initials": "A", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-1578-0922"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Nuclear Medicine, CHU Caen, CHU Cote de Nacre, Caen, France."}, {"affiliation": "Normandy University, EA 4650, Caen, France."}, {"affiliation": "Cyceron PET Center, Caen, France."}]}}]}, "authorIdList": {"authorId": [{"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-1578-0922"}]}, "dataLinksTagsList": {"dataLinkstag": ["altmetrics", "supporting_data"]}, "journalInfo": {"issue": "7", "volume": "45", "journalIssueId": 2685161, "dateOfPublication": "2018 Jul", "monthOfPublication": 7, "yearOfPublication": 2018, "journal": {"medlineAbbreviation": "Eur J Nucl Med Mol Imaging", "title": "European journal of nuclear medicine and molecular imaging", "essn": "1619-7089", "issn": "1619-7070", "isoabbreviation": "Eur J Nucl Med Mol Imaging", "nlmid": "101140988"}, "printPublicationDate": "2018-07-01"}, "pubYear": "2018", "pageInfo": "1079-1090", "abstractText": "<h4>Purpose</h4>We assessed the feasibility of myocardial blood flow (MBF) and flow reserve (MFR) estimation using dynamic SPECT with a novel CZT camera in patients with stable CAD, in comparison with <sup>15</sup>O-water PET and fractional flow reserve (FFR).<h4>Methods</h4>Thirty patients were prospectively included and underwent FFR measurements in the main coronary arteries (LAD, LCx, RCA). A stenosis ≥50% was considered obstructive and a FFR abnormal if ≤0.8. All patients underwent a dynamic rest/stress <sup>99m</sup>Tc-sestamibi CZT-SPECT and <sup>15</sup>O-water PET for MBF and MFR calculation. Net retention kinetic modeling was applied to SPECT data to estimate global uptake values, and MBF was derived using Leppo correction. Ischemia by PET and CZT-SPECT was considered present if MFR was lower than 2 and 2.1, respectively.<h4>Results</h4>CZT-SPECT yielded higher stress and rest MBF compared to PET for global and LAD and LCx territories, but not in RCA territory. MFR was similar in global and each vessel territory for both modalities. The sensitivity, specificity, accuracy, positive and negative predictive value of CZT-SPECT were, respectively, 83.3, 95.8, 93.3, 100 and 85.7% for the detection of ischemia and 58.3, 84.6, 81.1, 36.8 and 93% for the detection of hemodynamically significant stenosis (FFR ≤ 0.8).<h4>Conclusions</h4>Dynamic <sup>99m</sup>Tc-sestamibi CZT-SPECT was technically feasible and provided similar MFR compared to <sup>15</sup>O-water PET and high diagnostic value for detecting impaired MFR and abnormal FFR in patients with stable CAD.", "affiliation": "Department of Nuclear Medicine, CHU Caen, CHU Cote de Nacre, Caen, France. agostini-de@chu-caen.fr.", "publicationStatus": "ppublish", "language": "eng", "pubModel": "Print-Electronic", "pubTypeList": {"pubType": ["research-article", "Validation Study", "Journal Article"]}, "grantsList": {"grant": [{"agency": "Spectrum Dynamics Ltd.", "orderIn": 0}]}, "meshHeadingList": {"meshHeading": [{"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Humans"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Water"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Oxygen Radioisotopes"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "descriptorName": "Technetium Tc 99m Sestamibi"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "descriptorName": "Tomography, Emission-Computed, Single-Photon"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Coronary Angiography"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Aged"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Aged, 80 and over"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Middle Aged"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Female"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Male"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Fractional Flow Reserve, Myocardial"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Coronary Artery Disease", "meshQualifierList": {"meshQualifier": [{"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "abbreviation": "DG", "qualifierName": "diagnostic imaging"}]}}, {"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "descriptorName": "Myocardial Perfusion Imaging"}]}, "keywordList": {"keyword": ["Myocardial blood flow", "coronary artery disease", "Fractional Flow Reserve", "Myocardial Flow Reserve", "Dynamic Spect", "Czt Camera", "15O–water Pet"]}, "chemicalList": {"chemical": [{"name": "Oxygen Radioisotopes", "registryNumber": "0"}, {"name": "Water", "registryNumber": "059QF0KO0R"}, {"name": "Technetium Tc 99m Sestamibi", "registryNumber": "971Z4W1S09"}, {"name": "Oxygen-15", "registryNumber": "0"}]}, "subsetList": {"subset": [{"code": "IM", "name": "Index Medicus"}]}, "fullTextUrlList": {"fullTextUrl": [{"availability": "Open access", "availabilityCode": "OA", "documentStyle": "pdf", "site": "Unpaywall", "url": "https://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1007%2Fs00259-018-3958-7.pdf"}, {"availability": "Subscription required", "availabilityCode": "S", "documentStyle": "doi", "site": "DOI", "url": "https://doi.org/10.1007/s00259-018-3958-7"}, {"availability": "Open access", "availabilityCode": "OA", "documentStyle": "html", "site": "Europe_PMC", "url": "https://europepmc.org/articles/PMC5953996"}, {"availability": "Open access", "availabilityCode": "OA", "documentStyle": "pdf", "site": "Europe_PMC", "url": "https://europepmc.org/articles/PMC5953996?pdf=render"}]}, "isOpenAccess": "Y", "inEPMC": "Y", "inPMC": "Y", "citedByCount": 175, "hasReferences": "Y", "hasTextMinedTerms": "Y", "hasDbCrossReferences": "N", "hasPDF": "Y", "hasBook": "N", "hasSuppl": "N", "hasLabsLinks": "Y", "hasData": "Y", "license": "cc by", "authMan": "N", "epmcAuthMan": "N", "nihAuthMan": "N", "hasTMAccessionNumbers": "Y", "tmAccessionTypeList": {"accessionType": ["nct"]}, "dateOfCompletion": "2018-12-12", "dateOfCreation": "2018-03-03", "dateOfRevision": "2024-03-25", "electronicPublicationDate": "2018-03-01", "firstPublicationDate": "2018-03-01", "firstIndexDate": "2018-03-03", "fullTextReceivedDate": "2025-02-03", "hasEvaluations": "N"}]}}